 "strings": {
  "(I wonder if Ayabe knows a place.)": "",
  "(Though with how much time he spends at Tender,\nhe probably knows more about booze than bakeries.)": "",
  "(Either way, Kuroiwa's got him on lockdown right now.\nWouldn't be very smart to be seen together.)": "",
  "(Hm, asking Saori-san herself\nwould be the quickest way.)": "",
  "(Though I'm sure she'd just\nget suspicious if I did that.)": "",
  "(I can't talk to her about it\nuntil I actually have the dessert in question.)": "",
  "(I bet Tsukumo could find something\nreally easily.)": "",
  "(Hey, that's a good idea!\nI can have him do another search for me!)": "",
  "(Just gotta give him a call.)": "",
  "How's it going, Yagami-shi?": "",
  "Yagami-shi! How's it going?": "",
  "There's something I need help finding.": "",
  "There's something I need\nyour help finding.": "",
  "Ooh. What is it this time?": "",
  "I need the king of desserts. Something that\na sweet tooth hound would do anything to get.": "",
  "I need something for a real hardcore sweet tooth.\nSome dessert that a girl would just about die for.": "",
  "Hehehe, that's the oldest trick in the book!\nYou think a modern woman's gonna fall for that one?": "",
  "Hehehe! Yagami-shi, that's the oldest trick in the book!\nYou think a modern woman would really fall for that?": "",
  "Oh yeah. Guys still do it,\nand girls still eat it up.": "",
  "Really? Dating sounds pretty stupid. But anyway,\nI'm up for a search. Hit me with some keywords.": "",
  "Is that so? Well, give me some keywords\nand I'll scan Chatter for you again.": "",
  "Hm, let's try \"sweets\" and \"limited.\"": "",
  "Okay... How about:\n\"sweets\" and \"limited\"?": "",
  "Let's give it a shot.\nSharing my screen with you now.": "",
  "Roger. Sharing my screen\nwith you now.": "",
  "Hmmm, that's hundreds of hits too many.\nCan't do a lot with results like that.": "",
  "Hmmm, not much help there. Over 999 hits.\nResults like that won't tell you anything.": "",
  "So much for limited.": "",
  "So much for \"limited.\"": "",
  "Let's try adding another word\nto narrow it down, Yagami-shi.": "",
  "Yagami-shi? Give me another word,\nso we can narrow this down.": "",
  "(Something that Saori-san would die for...\nWhat words would get me closer?)": "",
  "Nope, barely made a dent.\nGuess the whole country's dying for matcha.": "",
  "No good there. Barely made a dent.\nGuess the whole country's dying for matcha.": "",
  "It's the only damn flavor anyone makes!": "",
  "For crying out loud, it's the only goddamn flavor\nanyone makes these days!": "",
  "Well, looks like that's out of the question.\nLet's uh, try something else.": "",
  "Well, looks like matcha's out of the question.\nLet's try something else.": "",
  "Hmmm. That sorta worked, but not well enough.\nYour girl especially into red beans?": "",
  "Hmmm. That sorta worked, but not well enough.\nYour target especially into red beans?": "",
  "Nah, she's not too picky.": "",
  "Nah, not especially.": "",
  "How about we try something else then?": "",
  "Mm, well... How about we try\nsomething else, then?": "",
  "Incredible!\nYou narrowed it down to one result!": "",
  "Whoa, awesome!\nYou narrowed it down to one result!": "",
  "Really!? Nice!": "",
  "Seriously? Great!": "",
  "(Wait, this is Hoshino's account!\nThis is what he posts about?)": "",
  "...Yagami-shi?": "",
  "Oh, uh... This one isn't gonna work.\nLet's try a different word.": "",
  "Hey, that one brought it down a lot!": "",
  "Nice job!\nThat one brought it down a lot!": "",
  "Hmmm, smart, smart. I'd never have thought\nto go by the shop and not the snack.": "",
  "I see, smart, smart... I'd never have thought to\ngo by the shop and not the snack.": "",
  "I mean, she can't have had a dessert\nfrom a store that just opened.": "",
  "Yeah. I figure if the shop only just opened,\nshe probably hasn't tried any of their stuff.": "",
  "Heh, that's my Yagami-shi.\nShould be easy to keep going from here.": "",
  "That's my Yagami-shi. Should be easy\nto keep going from here.": "",
  "Yeah. Let's toss \"Kamurocho\" into the mix.": "",
  "Yup. Let's toss \"Kamurocho\"\ninto the mix.": "",
  "That did it!": "",
  "Nice! That did it!": "",
  "What do we have here? \"Famous Kyoto sweet shop\nTakemitsu's Kamurocho branch now open on Shichifuku Street.\"": "",
  "Let's see... \"Famous Kyoto sweet shop Takemitsu's\nKamurocho branch now open on Shichifuku Street.\"": "",
  "Perfect!\nI'll head over there now.": "",
  "You know those are limited quantity, right?\nI dunno if you can still get them this time of day...": "",
  "Hold on, Yagami-shi, aren't those limited stock?\nAre there even any left?": "",
  "Guess I should get moving, then.": "",
  "Guess I'd better go find out, right?": "",
  "Heh. I don't know who you're going through all this trouble for...\nbut she's a lucky girl. Good luck, Yagami-shi.": "",
  "If this is for your sweetheart or some other\nplan you're cooking, I hope she loves it!": "",
  "Gotta run, Tsukumo.\nThanks again!": "",
  "Gotta run now.\nThank you!": "",
  "I'll be rooting for you!": "",
  "I'll be rooting for you! Bye!": "",
  "Look, pal.": "",
  "I don't care how long you've been runnin' in Kyoto.\nIf you wanna open a shop in this town, you gotta follow the rules.": "",
  "I don't care how long you've been runnin' in Kyoto.\nIf you wanna open shop here, you follow our rules.": "",
  "I told you,\nI already submitted all my documents!": "",
  "I-I told you, I already submitted\nall my documents!": "",
  "We don't give a shit about your documents!\nThis is about knowin' your place.": "",
  "And I said, we don't give a shit about <font_kind=yakuza_italic>documents</font_kind>!\nThis is about knowin' your place.": "",
  "You don't mean... protection money?": "",
  "You don't mean...\nthis is about protection money?": "",
  "Protection? I don't know what you're talkin' about.\nWe just wanna make sure you're following the rules.": "",
  "'Scuse me.\nMind if I squeeze past you fellas?": "",
  "Uh... 'Scuse me.\nMind if I squeeze past you fellas?": "",
  "And who the hell're you, huh?": "",
  "Huh!? And who the hell're you?": "",
  "Sorry buddy, but you're gonna have to come back later.\nWe're in the middle of somethin'.": "",
  "I'm looking for one of\nyour special mochi, sir.": "",
  "Huh? Well, um...": "",
  "This ain't a joke, asshole!\nWe're talkin' here!": "",
  "This ain't a joke, asshole!\nWe're in the middle of a conversation here!": "",
  "You better beat it before\nthis gets ugly.": "",
  "Buddy... I suggest you beat it\nbefore this gets ugly.": "",
  "If anyone needs to \"beat it,\" it's you.": "",
  "Somebody might see you shaking this poor guy down\nand call the cops. Heck, I'll do it myself.": "",
  "Hmph. You think you're safe 'cause\nyou're a civilian, huh? Well think again.": "",
  "Hmph. You think you're safe 'cause you're a civilian, huh?\nWell, think again.": "",
  "C'mon, let's wreck this shithead and show\nthese Kyoto fucks how things work 'round here!": "",
  "C'mon, let's wreck this shithead\nand show these Kyoto fucks how things work 'round here!": "",
  "Everyone raves about this place online.\nWe're so lucky they opened a branch here in Kamurocho!": "",
  "Mannn, only one per person?\nGuess I can't complain. Least I got one!": "",
  "Mannn, only one per person?\nGuess I can't complain. At least I got one!": "",
  "Some kinda famous sweets shop, huh?\nNo line, though. Guess they're sold out.": "",
  "Dude, what the shit...": "",
  "Leave now and I won't call the cops.\nNow go.": "",
  "Leave now and I won't call the cops.\nBut you'd better move quick.": "",
  "Thank you so much, sir.": "",
  "Um... Thank you so much, sir.": "",
  "Oh, that? It was nothing.": "",
  "Oh, no problem.\nIt was nothing.": "",
  "As I was saying,\nI'm looking for one of your special mochi.": "",
  "My apologies, sir.\nWe're all sold out for today.": "",
  "Sold out!? Dammit,\nI should've come sooner...!": "",
  "Sold out!? Gah...\nDammit, I should've come sooner...!": "",
  "Hm... Wait, sir!\nI think I have one!": "",
  "We keep a few separate from our regular sales batch.\nYou know, for TV interviews and the like.": "",
  "We keep a few separate from our regular sales batch.\nYou know, stock for TV interviews and the like.": "",
  "There still should be some of those left.": "",
  "There should still be\nsome of those left.": "",
  "Wow, you guys are the real deal.\nThink I could buy one?": "",
  "Wow, you guys are the real deal.\nSo... think I could buy one?": "",
  "You can have one for free after what you did today.\nI insist.": "",
  "You can have one for free after what you did today!\nI insist.": "",
  "Really? I guess if you don't mind...": "",
  "Whoa, really?\nI guess if you don't mind...": "",
  "Well, I should be going.\nThank you again, sir.": "",
  "(Finally found the perfect gift for Saori-san.\nJust gotta head to Genda's now.)": "",
  "Genda-sensei. How do you feel?": "",
  "Genda-sensei.\nHow do you feel?": "",
  "Fine, I guess.\nJust got back in the office.": "",
  "Fine.\nJust got back in the office.": "",
  "Oh, Saori-san.\nI got you this.": "",
  "Oh, Saori-san. Here.": "",
  "Sorry, do you mind if I talk\nto Saori-san real quick?": "",
  "Ah, sorry. You mind if I\ntalk to Saori-san real quick?": "",
  "This comes first.\nWe've got business.": "",
  "Take a seat.": "",
  "You're not talking your way outta this one, Yagami.\nHoshino-kun told me everything.": "",
  "Hoshino-kun told me everything.\nYou're not talking your way outta this one, Yagami.": "",
  "Everything about...?": "",
  "He told you about...?": "",
  "All this shit with Shintani. I told you to back off,\nbut you went and dug even deeper.": "",
  "All this shit with Shintani. I said to back off,\nbut you went and dug even deeper.": "",
  "Now you've got Hoshino-kun\nwrapped up in this.": "",
  "You're even getting Hoshino-kun\nwrapped up in it.": "",
  "Shintani was practically a son to me.\nSure I've told you that before.": "",
  "I've told you before. All these years,\nShintani was practically a son to me.": "",
  "Knowing he's gone...\nI can barely get up in the morning.": "",
  "Knowing he's gone...\nI've barely been able to function.": "",
  "My appetite's gone too,\nand I'm just forcing down food.": "",
  "I couldn't even eat until yesterday.": "",
  "What am I gonna do if I lose you\nand Hoshino-kun, too?": "",
  "What am I gonna do if I lose\nyou and Hoshino-kun, too?": "",
  "Something came to me when I was\nin bed thinking about this.": "",
  "Something came to me when I was\nlying in bed thinking about this.": "",
  "If things keep going down this path, is it even\nwise to keep this office up and running?": "",
  "Maybe keeping this office open in\nKamurocho is just a magnet for trouble.": "",
  "That's not how I wanna\nthink about it, though.": "",
  "But still... I'm not giving up.": "",
  "One of my own gets murdered, and I respond by\nlying in bed whimpering about it? Not happening.": "",
  "One of my own gets murdered, and all I do is\nlie in bed crying all day? I know that's not right.": "",
  "If you don't have the will to fight,\nyou're never gonna last in this town.": "",
  "In this town, you'll never last\nunless you've got the will to fight.": "",
  "Every single person in Kamurocho's pursuing a dream.\nTrying to claw their way forward, bit by bit.": "",
  "We stick it out in Kamurocho. Every single one of us.\nTrying to claw our way forward bit by bit.": "",
  "If you don't wanna get your ass chewed\nup and spat out...": "",
  "And we know, if you don't wanna get\nchewed up and spat out...": "",
  "You've gotta keep fighting.\nEven if you have to fake it.": "",
  "You've still gotta fight back,\neven if you're faking it. I know this, and now...": "",
  "If I can't fight after what happened to Shintani,\nI might as well just close up shop.": "",
  "If I can't fight after what happened to Shintani,\nI may as well close up shop. Am I wrong?": "",
  "Yagami. You're serious about this, aren't you?\nYou really wanna avenge Shintani?": "",
  "Yagami. You're serious about this, aren't you?\nYou're really out for vengeance? ": "",
  "Good!": "",
  "In that case,\nHoshino-kun is at your disposal.": "",
  "Then... I'll leave Hoshino-kun\nat your disposal if you need him.": "",
  "I'll eat the costs 'til this murder is solved.\nWe're gonna find Shintani's killer, no matter what.": "",
  "And until we do, I'll pitch in however I can.\nYou just say the word.": "",
  "Of course, I'll pitch in however I can.\nAll you've gotta do is say the word.": "",
  "Thank you, Genda-sensei.": "",
  "One condition, though.\nNo more victims.": "",
  "My condition is no more victims.": "",
  "After everything that's already happened,\nI can't afford to lose anyone else.": "",
  "We'll be careful.": "",
  "As for the next step in our investigation...": "",
  "But, as for the next step\nin our investigation...": "",
  "I'm gonna need a little help.\nFrom Saori-san.": "",
  "Saori-kun?": "",
  "Good, aren't they? By the way...\nThere's something I need to ask you.": "",
  "Absolutely not.": "",
  "Come on, Saori-san.\nYou ate all that mochi, didn't you?": "",
  "But it's guaranteed!\nLook, you ate all that mochi, didn't you?": "",
  "Those were a trap?\nI don't approve of such trickery.": "",
  "That was a trap, then...?\nYou're playing dirty.": "",
  "C'mon, could be fun being\na hostess for a day.": "",
  "C'mon, it could be fun\nbeing a hostess for a day.": "",
  "Though what that club owner sees in you\nis beyond me, that's for sure...": "",
  "Though I have to wonder,\nwhat did the club manager see in you...?": "",
  "It'll be fine, Saori-san. We're not asking you\nto be their number one girl.": "",
  "It'll be fine, really. We're not asking you to\nbecome their number one girl.": "",
  "If we got you a new dress, you'd look the part.\nIt'll be one of those extreme makeovers.": "",
  "You'll look the part if you just get the right clothes.\nWe can even make you look younger, too.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Maybe this is a lost cause...)</color>": "",
  "What about that mochi?\nI'll get you some more if you do it...": "",
  "What about that mochi?\nI could get you some more...": "",
  "I don't think she's\ngonna budge, Yagami.": "",
  "...She's not gonna budge.": "",
  "Guess not. I don't even know if\nthe manager was that serious anyway...": "",
  "Guess not. Though I dunno if the manager\nwas that serious anyway...": "",
  "What do you mean,\n\"not that serious\"!?": "",
  "What do you mean, \"not that serious\"!?": "",
  "What do you see when you\nlook at Saori-san? Huh!?": "",
  "Look at her! What do you see\nwhen you look at Saori-san?": "",
  "No, it's not that, she's just...\nclearly not into the idea.": "",
  "But, uh...\nSaori-san doesn't seem too into it.": "",
  "Why would she be with the way\nyou're approaching it!?": "",
  "That's because you two\ncouldn't be ruder about it!": "",
  "Talking about how she doesn't have to be\nthe number one girl or giving her a makeover...": "",
  "Saying she doesn't have to be number one,\nor that she has to look younger?": "",
  "If you'd look a little closer,\nmaybe you'd understand!": "",
  "Try looking closer\nand maybe you'll understand!": "",
  "Saori-san could be the best hostess in this\nwhole damn town if she wanted to!": "",
  "Saori-san could be the number one hostess in\nall Kamurocho if she wanted to!": "",
  "Isn't that right, Saori-san?": "",
  "...If you really believe that,\nI guess I could give it a try.": "",
  "...If you really believe that,\nI could try it.": "",
  "I'll do it.\nI'll be Kamurocho's number one hostess.": "",
  "See what I mean!?": "",
  "Okay, uh, you can pick out a dress, Yagami-san.\nA-And she'll need a haircut and makeup, too.": "",
  "You can pick out a dress, Yagami-san.\nShe'll need a haircut and makeup, too.": "",
  "You don't mind shelling out\nfor this, do you?": "",
  "Hm? No, it's fine.\nBut... I have to pick the dress?": "",
  "Hm? No, but...\ndo I have to pick the dress?": "",
  "Don't worry, there's a shop around here that caters\nexclusively to hostesses looking for outfits.": "",
  "Don't worry, this is Kamurocho! There's a shop here\nwith clothes especially for hostesses.": "",
  "You can't go wrong at a place like that.": "",
  "You can't go wrong\nat a place like that.": "",
  "But how's she gonna be the best if she goes\nto the same store as all the other girls?": "",
  "But... would the \"number one\"\nwear the usual stuff...?": "",
  "The primary goal here is finding out what Hashiki\nand Shono were talking about, right?": "",
  "The primary goal here is finding out\nwhat Hashiki and Shono were talking about, right?": "",
  "W-Well, yeah...": "",
  "Then stop complaining.": "",
  "Becoming the best will\njust happen naturally.": "",
  "Becoming number one will\njust happen naturally.": "",
  "Let's go, Yagami-san.\nWe have a dress to buy.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Good!": "เยี่ยม!",
  "Absolutely not.": "ไม่เอาเด็ดขาด",
  "W-Well, yeah...": "ก-ก็ใช่น่ะครับ..."
 }
}
